    <string name="intro1_title">Scan anything\nin seconds</string>
    <string name="intro1_body">Point your camera and ClassicScan finds the page edges, straightens the photo and cleans away shadows. Turn on auto-capture and it takes the photo the moment the page is still.</string>
    <string name="intro2_title">A mode for\nevery paper</string>
    <string name="intro2_body">Put both sides of an ID card on one printable page, split a book into two pages, clean up a whiteboard, or read QR codes and barcodes and act on them.</string>
    <string name="intro3_title">It reads the\nwords for you</string>
    <string name="intro3_body">Every page is read right on your phone. Find any scan by a word inside it, copy text into a message, and export PDFs you can search.</string>
    <string name="intro4_title">Polish and\nsign</string>
    <string name="intro4_body">Fine-tune the crop with a magnifier, pick a filter, adjust brightness and contrast, and sign or mark up pages. Your original photo is always kept.</string>
    <string name="intro5_title">Yours, and\nonly yours</string>
    <string name="intro5_body">No account, no uploads. Everything stays on this phone, and app lock keeps prying eyes out. Files leave only when you share them.</string>
